// Title: Potential Script Proxy Execution Via CL_Mutexverifiers.ps1
// Rule ID: 1e0e1a81-e79b-44bc-935b-ddb9c8006b3d
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1216
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
